WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Kevin walks into the office carrying a huge pot of homemade chili.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
He struggles to keep the heavy pot steady as he makes his way across the room.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Suddenly, he trips and spills the chili all over the floor.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The chili spreads across the office carpet.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Kevin desperately tries to put the chili back into the pot.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:44.000
His coworkers watch in disbelief as he attempts to clean up the mess.